# Test your FastAPI endpoints

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### User login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "role": "user"
}

### Worker login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "worker01",
  "role": "worker"
}

### Register AI
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ais
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "heritage-ai",
  "api_url": "https://example.com/qa",
  "initial_score": 2.0
}

### Submit task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-1",
  "question": "三星堆青铜面具有什么文化意义？",
  "answer_format": "三点要点",
  "ai_ids": ["ai-id-from-register-response"],
  "worker_count": 1
}

### Worker hall
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/workers/hall
Accept: application/json

### Worker accept task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/workers/tasks/task-id/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_id": "worker-2"
}

### Worker answer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/workers/tasks/task-id/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responder_id": "worker-2",
  "content": "青铜面具体现祭祀、权力象征和古蜀审美。"
}

### AI answer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ais/tasks/task-id/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responder_id": "ai-id-from-register-response",
  "content": "三星堆青铜面具反映古蜀祭祀体系、社会权力结构与区域文化交流。"
}

### User messages
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/user-1/messages
Accept: application/json

